elastic-esql-datasource-splunk

This product includes software derived from splunker
(https://github.com/fionera/splunker), by Fionera and Tim Windelschmidt,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The Splunk journal decoder (JournalDecoder.java) is a Java port of
splunker's journal decoding logic, modified for streaming reads,
fail-fast handling of corrupt input, and use as an
ES|QL data source.
